#     direct AND transitive dependency. Regenerate with:
#       pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
#       pip-compile requirements.in --output-file requirements.txt
#   - setup.py: reads this file directly at import time
#     (`install_requires=_read_requirements("requirements.in")`) instead
#     of duplicating the list — see setup.py's `_read_requirements()`.
#
# Dev-only tools (pip-tools, pip-audit) live in requirements-dev.txt, not
# here — they are never a runtime dependency of the installed package.

